shipName = Kerman Engineering SAV-920
description = The Cumulus Aerospace C920neo-x is the latest version of the pigeon-size aircraft model. It is the sucessor to the Advanced Aerospace C01-NEO. It features winglets, a redesigned rear stabilizer, speed brakes, a new tail, flaps and lights that are compliant with newer aviation regulations. To compesate for the removed rear engine, two additional Juno engines have been added.
